CLOSURE_CHECKS_CLASSIFIER_AUDIT: {
  "schema_version": 1,
  "migration_run_id": "8b32109d-1521-469b-80aa-b273da3e8ddb",
  "snapshot_timestamp": "2026-05-22T00:37:58Z",
  "ticket_id": "aab2-356d",
  "items": [
    {
      "original_text": "When brainstorm creates follow-on or split epics, each passes through the full scrutiny pipeline before ticket creation \u2014 with a follow-on depth parameter (max 1) passed to the scrutiny pipeline to prevent recursive loops; follow-on epics of follow-on epics are presented as ticket stubs for user approval without re-entering scrutiny",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior for how the brainstorm feature handles epic creation and scrutiny pipeline processing"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "When feasibility gaps are unresolved, brainstorm returns to the Phase 1 understanding loop for additional research and user alignment \u2014 bounded by brainstorm.max_feasibility_cycles (default 2) with user escalation after exhaustion",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior where the brainstorming process loops back to Phase 1 when feasibility gaps persist, bounded by a configurable cycle limit"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "When preplanning surfaces unresolved feasibility gaps during Integration Research, it emits REPLAN_ESCALATE: brainstorm to route back through the understanding loop",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior where the preplanning component performs an ongoing action (emits a signal) when conditions are met"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "When an epic involves LLM prompt logic, the scrutiny pipeline triggers a prompt-alignment step: provider-agnostic prior-art search on GitHub for similar prompts in popular AI/LLM projects, collaborative drafting of prompt text with the user, and dispatch of dso:bot-psychologist via Agent tool to review the draft \u2014 with findings incorporated into the epic spec before approval",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes an ongoing system process that runs whenever a condition is met, establishing durable behavior rather than a one-time completion"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "The bot-psychologist dispatch is conditional, triggered by a canonical LLM-instruction signal keyword list defined in the scrutiny pipeline (skill file modifications, agent definitions, prompt templates, hook behavioral logic) with exclusion for documentation-only epics whose Approach section references only doc files",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior where the dispatch mechanism operates conditionally based on defined signals and exclusion rules"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "The brainstorm planning-intelligence log records when each new mechanism engages: whether follow-on scrutiny ran (and depth), whether the feasibility-resolution loop cycled (count and triggering gap), and whether the LLM-instruction signal fired (matched keyword) \u2014 providing a traceable audit trail for retrospective analysis",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system capability to record and provide audit trails for planning-intelligence mechanisms, phrased as ongoing behavior"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    }
  ]
}
